{
  "_comment": [
    "iTantra language-pack manifest.",
    "",
    "Source models (AI4Bharat, MIT):",
    "  STT  IndicConformer-120M  https://huggingface.co/ai4bharat  (.nemo checkpoints)",
    "  TTS  Indic-TTS FastPitch + HiFi-GAN V1  https://github.com/AI4Bharat/Indic-TTS",
    "",
    "Those upstream artifacts are NeMo/PyTorch checkpoints and cannot be run on-device",
    "as published. Export each to ONNX, quantize to int8, then publish the resulting",
    "files and fill in 'url' and 'sha256' below. Until both fields are set for a file,",
    "the Model Manager treats it as unpublished and refuses to install it rather than",
    "trusting an unverified download (Rules §19).",
    "",
    "During development you can skip publishing entirely and sideload instead:",
    "  adb push <file> /sdcard/Android/data/com.itantra/files/models/<lang>/<fileName>",
    "ModelStore picks those up automatically.",
    "",
    "sizeBytes is only used to show a download estimate; it is not enforced."
  ],

  "languages": [
    {
      "lang": "hi",
      "displayName": "Hindi",
      "nativeName": "हिन्दी",
      "bundled": true,
      "models": [
